msgstr "Installationsprogram hämtat från blender.org:"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Microsoft Store installation:"
msgstr "Installation i Microsoft Store:"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"``BLENDER_SYSTEM_SCRIPTS`` and ``BLENDER_SYSTEM_EXTENSIONS`` "
