#. from yeager:blender
msgid "User Preference (see :ref:`prefs-file-paths`)."
msgstr "Användarinställningar (se :ref:`prefs-file-paths`)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Environment variables (``TEMP`` on Windows, ``TMP`` & ``TMP_DIR`` on other "
"platforms)."
msgstr ""
"Miljövariabler (`TEMP` på Windows, `TMP` & `TMP_DIR` på andra plattformar)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "The ``/tmp/`` directory."
msgstr "Katalogen `/tmp/`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Command Line Arguments"
msgstr "Argument på kommandoraden"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Blender |BLENDER_VERSION|"
msgstr "Blender |BLENDER_VERSION|"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Usage: ``blender [args ...] [file] [args ...]``"
msgstr "Användning: `blender [args ...] [file] [args ...]`"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Render Options"
msgstr "Renderingsalternativ"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-b``, ``--background``"
msgstr "``-b``, ``--background``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Run in background (often used for UI-less rendering)."
msgstr ""
"Körs i bakgrunden (används ofta för rendering utan användargränssnitt)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"The audio device is disabled in background-mode by default and can be re-"
"enabled by passing in ``-setaudio Default`` afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Ljudenheten är inaktiverad i bakgrundsläget som standard och kan "
"återaktiveras genom att skicka in `-setaudio Default` efteråt."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-a``, ``--render-anim``"
msgstr "``-a``, ``--render-anim``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Render frames from start to end (inclusive)."
msgstr "Rendera bildrutor från början till slut (inklusive)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-S``, ``--scene`` ``<name>``"
msgstr "``-S``, ``--scene`` ``<namn>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Set the active scene ``<name>`` for rendering."
msgstr "Ställ in den aktiva scenen `<name>` för rendering."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-f``, ``--render-frame`` ``<frame>``"
msgstr "``-f``, ``--render-frame`` ``<bildruta>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Render frame ``<frame>`` and save it."
msgstr "Rendera ramen `<frame>` och spara den."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``+<frame>`` start frame relative, ``-<frame>`` end frame relative."
msgstr "`+<frame>` startram relativ, `-<frame>` slutram relativ."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "A comma separated list of frames can also be used (no spaces)."
msgstr ""
"En kommaseparerad lista med ramar kan också användas (inga mellanslag)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"A range of frames can be expressed using ``..`` separator between the first "
"and last frames (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Ett antal ramar kan uttryckas med hjälp av `..` mellan den första och den "
"sista ramen (inklusive)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-s``, ``--frame-start`` ``<frame>``"
msgstr "``-s``, ``--frame-start`` ``<bildruta>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Set start to frame ``<frame>``, supports +/- for relative frames too."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in start till ram `<frame>`, stöder +/- för relativa ramar också."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-e``, ``--frame-end`` ``<frame>``"
msgstr "``-e``, ``--frame-end`` ``<bildruta>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Set end to frame ``<frame>``, supports +/- for relative frames too."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in slutet på ramen `<frame>`, stöder +/- för relativa ramar också."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-j``, ``--frame-jump`` ``<frames>``"
msgstr "``-j``, ``--frame-jump`` ``<bildrutor>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Set number of frames to step forward after each rendered frame."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in antalet bildrutor som ska stegas framåt efter varje renderad "
"bildruta."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-o``, ``--render-output`` ``<path>``"
msgstr "``-o``, ``--render-output`` ``<sökväg>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Set the render path and file name. Use ``//`` at the start of the path to "
"render relative to the blend-file."
msgstr ""
"Ange sökväg och filnamn för rendering. Använd `//` i början av sökvägen för "
"att rendera relativt blend-filen."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"The ``#`` characters are replaced by the frame number, and used to define "
"zero padding."
msgstr ""
"Tecknen `#` ersätts av ramnumret och används för att definiera "
"nollutfyllnad."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``animation_##_test.png`` becomes ``animation_01_test.png``"
msgstr "`animation_##_test.png` blir `animation_01_test.png`"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``test-######.png`` becomes ``test-000001.png``"
msgstr "`test-######.png` blir `test-000001.png`"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"When the filename does not contain ``#``, the suffix ``####`` is added to "
"the filename."
msgstr ""
"Om filnamnet inte innehåller `#` läggs suffixet `####` till filnamnet."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "The frame number will be added at the end of the filename, eg:"
msgstr "Ramnumret kommer att läggas till i slutet av filnamnet, t.ex:"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"``//render_`` becomes ``//render_####``, writing frames as "
"``//render_0001.png``"
msgstr ""
"`//render_` blir `//render_####`, och skriver ramar som `//render_0001.png`"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-E``, ``--engine`` ``<engine>``"
msgstr "``-E``, ``--engine`` ``<motor>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Specify the render engine. Use ``-E help`` to list available engines."
msgstr ""
"Ange renderingsmotor. Använd `-E help` för att lista tillgängliga motorer."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-t``, ``--threads`` ``<threads>``"
msgstr "``-t``, ``--threads`` ``<trådar>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Use amount of ``<threads>`` for rendering and other operations [1-1024], 0 "
"to use the systems processor count."
msgstr ""
"Använd mängden `<threads>` för rendering och andra operationer [1-1024], 0 "
"för att använda systemets processorantal."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Cycles Render Options"
msgstr "Cycles Renderingsalternativ"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Cycles add-on options must be specified following a double dash."
msgstr "Cycles tilläggsalternativ måste specificeras efter ett dubbelstreck."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--cycles-device`` ``<device>``"
msgstr "``--cycles-device`` ``<enhet>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Set the device used for rendering. Valid options are: ``CPU`` ``CUDA`` "
"``OPTIX`` ``HIP`` ``ONEAPI`` ``METAL``."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in den enhet som används för rendering. Giltiga alternativ är: `CPU` "
"`CUDA` `OPTIX` `HIP` `ONEAPI` `METAL`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Append +CPU to a GPU device to render on both CPU and GPU."
msgstr "Lägg till +CPU till en GPU-enhet för att rendera på både CPU och GPU."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Exempel:"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--cycles-print-stats``"
msgstr "``--cycles-print-stats``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Log statistics about render memory and time usage."
msgstr "Logga statistik om minnes- och tidsanvändning för rendering."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Format Options"
msgstr "Alternativ för format"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-F``, ``--render-format`` ``<format>``"
msgstr "``-F``, ``--render-format`` ``<format>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Set the render format. Valid options are: ``TGA`` ``RAWTGA`` ``JPEG`` "
"``IRIS`` ``AVIRAW`` ``AVIJPEG`` ``PNG`` ``BMP`` ``HDR`` ``TIFF``."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in renderingsformatet. Giltiga alternativ är: `TGA` `RAWTGA` `JPEG` "
"`IRIS` `AVIRAW` `AVIJPEG` `PNG` `BMP` `HDR` `TIFF`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Formats that can be compiled into Blender, not available on all systems: "
"``OPEN_EXR`` ``OPEN_EXR_MULTILAYER`` ``FFMPEG`` ``CINEON`` ``DPX`` ``JP2`` "
"``WEBP``."
msgstr ""
"Format som kan kompileras till Blender, inte tillgängliga på alla system: "
"`OPEN_EXR` `OPEN_EXR_MULTILAYER` `FFMPEG` `CINEON` `DPX` `JP2` `WEBP`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-x``, ``--use-extension`` ``<bool>``"
msgstr "``-x``, ``--use-extension`` ``<bool>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Set option to add the file extension to the end of the file."
msgstr "Ange alternativ för att lägga till filändelsen i slutet av filen."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Animation Playback Options"
msgstr "Alternativ för uppspelning av animationer"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-a`` ``<options>`` ``<file(s)>``"
msgstr "``-a`` ``<options>`` ``<fil(er)>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Instead of showing Blender's user interface, this runs Blender as an "
"animation player, to view movies and image sequences rendered in Blender "
"(ignored if ``-b`` is set)."
msgstr ""
"Istället för att visa Blenders användargränssnitt körs Blender som en "
"animationsspelare för att visa filmer och bildsekvenser som renderas i "
"Blender (ignoreras om `-b` är inställt)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Playback Arguments:"
msgstr "Argument för uppspelning:"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-p`` ``<sx>`` ``<sy>``"
msgstr "``-p`` ``<sx>`` ``<sy>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Open with lower left corner at ``<sx>``, ``<sy>``."
msgstr "Öppna med nedre vänstra hörnet på ``<sx>``, ``<sy>``."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-m``"
msgstr "``-m``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Read from disk (Do not buffer)."
msgstr "Läs från disk (buffra inte)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-f`` ``<fps>`` ``<fps_base>``"
msgstr "``-f`` ``<fps>`` ``<fps_base>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Specify FPS to start with."
msgstr "Ange FPS till att börja med."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-j`` ``<frame>``"
msgstr "``-j`` ``<frame>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Set frame step to ``<frame>``."
msgstr "Ställ in ramsteg till `<frame>`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-s`` ``<frame>``"
msgstr "``-s`` ``<frame>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Play from ``<frame>``."
msgstr "Spela från `<frame>`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-e`` ``<frame>``"
msgstr "``-e`` ``<frame>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Play until ``<frame>``."
msgstr "Spela tills `<frame>`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-c`` ``<cache_memory>``"
msgstr "``-c`` ``<cache_memory>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Amount of memory in megabytes to allow for caching images during playback. "
"Zero disables (clamping to a fixed number of frames instead)."
msgstr ""
"Minnesmängd i megabyte för att tillåta cachning av bilder under uppspelning."
" Zero inaktiverar (fastlåsning till ett fast antal bilder i stället)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Window Options"
msgstr "Alternativ för fönster"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-w``, ``--window-border``"
msgstr "``-w``, ``--window-border``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Force opening with borders."
msgstr "Kraftöppning med gränser."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-W``, ``--window-fullscreen``"
msgstr "``-W``, ``--window-fullscreen``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Force opening in full-screen mode."
msgstr "Tvinga fram en öppning i helskärmsläge."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-p``, ``--window-geometry`` ``<sx>`` ``<sy>`` ``<w>`` ``<h>``"
msgstr "``-p``, ``--window-geometry`` ``<sx>`` ``<sy>`` ``<w>`` ``<h>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Open with lower left corner at ``<sx>``, ``<sy>`` and width and height as "
"``<w>``, ``<h>``."
msgstr ""
"Öppna med nedre vänstra hörnet på ``<sx>``, ``<sy>`` och bredd och höjd som "
"``<w>``, ``<h>``."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-M``, ``--window-maximized``"
msgstr "``-M``, ``--window-maximized``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Force opening maximized."
msgstr "Kraftöppning maximerad."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-con``, ``--start-console``"
msgstr "``-con``, ``--start-console``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Start with the console window open (ignored if ``-b`` is set), (Windows "
"only)."
msgstr ""
"Starta med konsolfönstret öppet (ignoreras om `-b` är inställt), (endast "
"Windows)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--no-native-pixels``"
msgstr "``--no-native-pixels``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Do not use native pixel size, for high resolution displays (MacBook "
"``Retina``)."
msgstr ""
"Använd inte den ursprungliga pixelstorleken för högupplösta skärmar (MacBook"
" `Retina`)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--no-window-focus``"
msgstr "``--no-window-focus``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Open behind other windows and without taking focus."
msgstr "Öppna bakom andra fönster och utan att ta fokus."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Python Options"
msgstr "Python-alternativ"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-y``, ``--enable-autoexec``"
msgstr "``-y``, ``--enable-autoexec``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable automatic Python script execution."
msgstr "Aktivera automatisk exekvering av Python-skript."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-Y``, ``--disable-autoexec``"
msgstr "``-Y``, ``--disable-autoexec``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Disable automatic Python script execution (Python-drivers & startup "
"scripts), (default)."
msgstr ""
"Inaktivera automatisk körning av Python-skript (Python-drivare och "
"startskript), (standard)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-P``, ``--python`` ``<filepath>``"
msgstr "``-P``, ``--python`` ``<filsökväg>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Run the given Python script file."
msgstr "Kör den angivna Python-skriptfilen."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--python-text`` ``<name>``"
msgstr "``--python-text`` ``<namn>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Run the given Python script text block."
msgstr "Kör det angivna textblocket för Python-skript."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--python-expr`` ``<expression>``"
msgstr "``--python-expr`` ``<uttryck>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Run the given expression as a Python script."
msgstr "Kör det angivna uttrycket som ett Python-skript."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--python-console``"
msgstr "``--python-console``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Run Blender with an interactive console."
msgstr "Kör Blender med en interaktiv konsol."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--python-exit-code`` ``<code>``"
msgstr "``--python-exit-code`` ``<kod>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Set the exit-code in [0..255] to exit if a Python exception is raised (only "
"for scripts executed from the command line), zero disables."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in exit-koden i [0..255] för att avsluta om ett Python-undantag "
"uppstår (endast för skript som körs från kommandoraden), noll inaktiverar."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--python-use-system-env``"
msgstr "``--python-use-system-env``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Allow Python to use system environment variables such as ``PYTHONPATH`` and "
"the user site-packages directory."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt Python att använda systemmiljövariabler som `PYTHONPATH` och "
"användarens webbplats-paketkatalog."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--addons`` ``<addon(s)>``"
msgstr "``--addons`` ``<tillägg>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Comma separated list (no spaces) of add-ons to enable in addition to any "
"default add-ons."
msgstr ""
"Kommaseparerad lista (inga mellanslag) över tillägg som ska aktiveras utöver"
" standardtilläggen."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Network Options"
msgstr "Nätverksinställningar"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--online-mode``"
msgstr "``--online-mode``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Allow internet access, overriding the preference."
msgstr "Tillåt internetåtkomst genom att åsidosätta inställningen."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--offline-mode``"
msgstr "``--offline-mode``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Disallow internet access, overriding the preference."
msgstr "Avvisa internetåtkomst, vilket åsidosätter inställningen."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Logging Options"
msgstr "Alternativ för loggning"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--log`` ``<match>``"
msgstr "``--log`` ``<match>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Enable logging categories, taking a single comma separated argument. "
"Multiple categories can be matched using a ``.*`` suffix, so ``--log "
"\"wm.*\"`` logs every kind of window-manager message. Sub-string can be "
"matched using a ``*`` prefix and suffix, so ``--log \"*undo*\"`` logs every "
"kind of undo-related message. Use \"^\" prefix to ignore, so ``--log "
"\"*,^wm.operator.*\"`` logs all except for ``wm.operators.*`` Use \"*\" to "
"log everything."
msgstr ""
"Aktiverar loggningskategorier, med ett enda kommaseparerat argument. Flera "
"kategorier kan matchas med hjälp av suffixet `.*`, så `--log \"wm.*\"` "
"loggar alla typer av meddelanden från Window Manager. Delsträngar kan "
"matchas med prefixet och suffixet `*`, så att `--log \"*undo*\"` loggar alla"
" typer av undorelaterade meddelanden. Använd prefixet \"^\" för att "
"ignorera, så `--log \"*,^wm.operator.*\"` loggar allt utom `wm.operators.*` "
"Använd \"*\" för att logga allt."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--log-level`` ``<level>``"
msgstr "``--log-level`` ``<nivå>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Set the logging verbosity level (higher for more details) defaults to 1, use"
" -1 to log all levels."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in loggningsnivån (högre för mer information) Standardvärde är 1, "
"använd -1 för att logga alla nivåer."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--log-show-basename``"
msgstr "``--log-show-basename``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Only show file name in output (not the leading path)."
msgstr "Visa endast filnamnet i utdata (inte den inledande sökvägen)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--log-show-backtrace``"
msgstr "``--log-show-backtrace``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Show a back trace for each log message (debug builds only)."
msgstr ""
"Visa en backspårning för varje loggmeddelande (endast debug-versioner)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--log-show-timestamp``"
msgstr "``--log-show-timestamp``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Show a timestamp for each log message in seconds since start."
msgstr "Visa en tidsstämpel för varje loggmeddelande i sekunder sedan start."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--log-file`` ``<filepath>``"
msgstr "``--log-file`` ``<filsökväg>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Set a file to output the log to."
msgstr "Ange en fil att mata ut loggen till."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Debug Options"
msgstr "Felsökningsalternativ"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``-d``, ``--debug``"
msgstr "``-d``, ``--debug``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Turn debugging on."
msgstr "Slå på felsökning."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enables memory error detection"
msgstr "Aktiverar detektering av minnesfel"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Disables mouse grab (to interact with a debugger in some cases)"
msgstr ""
"Inaktiverar musgrepp (för att interagera med en debugger i vissa fall)"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Keeps Python's ``sys.stdin`` rather than setting it to None"
msgstr "Behåller Pythons `sys.stdin` istället för att sätta den till None"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-value`` ``<value>``"
msgstr "``--debug-value`` ``<värde>``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Set debug value of ``<value>`` on startup."
msgstr "Ställ in debug-värdet för `<value>` vid start."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-events``"
msgstr "``--debug-events``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable debug messages for the event system."
msgstr "Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden för händelsesystemet."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-ffmpeg``"
msgstr "``--debug-ffmpeg``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable debug messages from FFmpeg library."
msgstr "Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden från FFmpeg-biblioteket."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-handlers``"
msgstr "``--debug-handlers``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable debug messages for event handling."
msgstr "Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden för händelsehantering."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-libmv``"
msgstr "``--debug-libmv``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable debug messages from libmv library."
msgstr "Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden från libmv-biblioteket."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-cycles``"
msgstr "``--debug-cycles``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable debug messages from Cycles."
msgstr "Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden från Cycles."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-memory``"
msgstr "``--debug-memory``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable fully guarded memory allocation and debugging."
msgstr "Möjliggör helt bevakad minnesallokering och felsökning."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-jobs``"
msgstr "``--debug-jobs``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable time profiling for background jobs."
msgstr "Aktivera tidsprofilering för bakgrundsjobb."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-python``"
msgstr "``--debug-python``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable debug messages for Python."
msgstr "Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden för Python."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-depsgraph``"
msgstr "``--debug-depsgraph``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable all debug messages from dependency graph."
msgstr "Aktivera alla felsökningsmeddelanden från beroendediagrammet."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-depsgraph-eval``"
msgstr "``--debug-depsgraph-eval``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable debug messages from dependency graph related on evaluation."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden från beroendediagram relaterade till "
"utvärdering."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-depsgraph-build``"
msgstr "``--debug-depsgraph-build``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Enable debug messages from dependency graph related on graph construction."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden från beroendediagram relaterade till "
"diagramkonstruktion."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-depsgraph-tag``"
msgstr "``--debug-depsgraph-tag``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable debug messages from dependency graph related on tagging."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden från beroendediagram relaterade till "
"taggning."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-depsgraph-no-threads``"
msgstr "``--debug-depsgraph-no-threads``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Switch dependency graph to a single threaded evaluation."
msgstr "Byt beroendediagram till en utvärdering med en enda tråd."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "``--debug-depsgraph-time``"
msgstr "``--debug-depsgraph-time``"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable debug messages from dependency graph related on timing."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera felsökningsmeddelanden från beroendediagram relaterade till timing."

