" a terminal from :menuselection:`Applications --> Utilities`. The path to "
"the executable in the ``.app`` folder is "
"``./Blender.app/Contents/MacOS/Blender``."
msgstr ""
"macOS använder \"filer\" med tillägget `.app` som kallas *applikationer*. "
