#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Extensions are **add-ons** or **themes** used to extend the core "
"functionality of Blender. They are shared in online platforms, and can be "
"installed and updated from within Blender."
msgstr ""
"Tillägg är **add-ons** eller **themes** som används för att utöka Blenders "
"kärnfunktionalitet. De delas på onlineplattformar och kan installeras och "
"uppdateras från Blender."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"The official extensions platform for the Blender project is "
"`extensions.blender.org <https://extensions.blender.org>`__. Other third "
"party sites can also be supported, as long as they follow the Extensions "
"Platform specification."
msgstr ""
"Den officiella plattformen för tillägg till Blender-projektet är "
"`extensions.blender.org <https://extensions.blender.org>`__. Andra "
"tredjepartswebbplatser kan också stödjas, så länge de följer specifikationen"
" för Extensions Platform."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"For extension add-on guidelines (requirements for "
"``extensions.blender.org``), refer to the `Developer Handbook "
"<https://developer.blender.org/docs/handbook/addons/guidelines/>`__."
msgstr ""
"För riktlinjer för tillägg av tillägg (krav för `extensions.blender.org`), "
"se `Developer Handbook "
"<https://developer.blender.org/docs/handbook/addons/guidelines/>`__."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"For the extension settings, and how to manage them, refer to the :ref:`User "
"Preferences <prefs-extensions>`."
msgstr ""
"För inställningar för tillägg och hur du hanterar dem, se :ref:`User "
"Preferences <prefs-extensions>`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"For managing extensions from the command line, refer to :ref:`Extension "
"Command Line Arguments <command_line-args-extensions>`."
msgstr ""
"För hantering av tillägg från kommandoraden, se :ref:`Extension Command Line"
" Arguments <command_line-args-extensions>`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Extension Licenses"
msgstr "Förlängning av licenser"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"The `Blender Extensions Platform <https://extensions.blender.org>`__ only "
"supports free and open source extensions compliant with the `Blender's "
"license <https://www.blender.org/about/license>`__:"
msgstr ""
"`Blender Extensions Platform <https://extensions.blender.org>`__ stöder "
"endast tillägg med fri och öppen källkod som överensstämmer med `Blenders "
"licens <https://www.blender.org/about/license>`__:"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"For add-ons, the required license is `GNU General Public License v3.0 or "
"later <https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-or-later.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"För tillägg krävs licensen `GNU General Public License v3.0 eller senare "
"<https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-or-later.html>`__."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"For themes, the recommended license is `GNU General Public License v3.0 or "
"later <https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-or-later.html>`__, but any `GPL-"
"compatible license <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/license-"
"list.en.html#GPLCompatibleLicenses>`__ is supported."
msgstr ""
"För teman är den rekommenderade licensen `GNU General Public License v3.0 "
"eller senare <https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-or-later.html>`__, men alla "
"`GPL-kompatibla licenser <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/license-"
"list.en.html#GPLCompatibleLicenses>`__ stöds."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"For assets used in add-ons, the required license is `Public Domain (CC0) "
"<https://spdx.org/licenses/CC0-1.0.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"För tillgångar som används i tilläggsprogram krävs licensen `Public Domain "
"(CC0) <https://spdx.org/licenses/CC0-1.0.html>`__."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Guidelines for wheel selecting the version to use."
msgstr "Riktlinjer för hjul som väljer vilken version som ska användas."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Finalize a policy for how conflicting versions of a wheel are handled."
msgstr ""
"Färdigställa en policy för hur motstridiga versioner av ett hjul ska "
"hanteras."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"`Python wheels <https://pythonwheels.com/>`__ (``*.whl``) are the standard "
"way of distributing Python modules. They are supported in Blender to make "
"self-contained Python :ref:`Extensions <extensions-index>`."
msgstr ""
"`Python wheels <https://pythonwheels.com/>`__ (`*.whl`) är standardmetoden "
"för att distribuera Python-moduler. De stöds i Blender för att göra "
"fristående Python :ref:`Extensions <extensions-index>`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Guidelines"
msgstr "Riktlinjer"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "By convention, always locate the files under ``./wheels/``."
msgstr "Enligt konvention ska filerna alltid placeras under `./wheels/`."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Krav"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Wheels must be bundled unmodified from `Python's package index "
"<https://pypi.org>`__."
msgstr ""
"Hjul måste buntas ihop omodifierade från `Pythons paketindex "
"<https://pypi.org>`__."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Wheels must include their dependencies."
msgstr "Wheels måste inkludera sina beroenden."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Wheels filenames must match Python's binary distribution specification: `see"
" docs <https://packaging.python.org/en/latest/specifications/binary-"
"distribution-format/#file-name-convention>`__. *Wheels downloaded from "
"Python's package index will follow this convention.*"
msgstr ""
"Hjulets filnamn måste överensstämma med Pythons binära "
"distributionsspecifikation: `se docs "
"<https://packaging.python.org/en/latest/specifications/binary-distribution-"
"format/#file-name-convention>`__. *Wheels som laddas ner från Pythons "
"paketindex kommer att följa denna konvention.*"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Use forward slashes as path separators when listing them on the "
":ref:`manifest <extensions-manifest>`."
msgstr ""
"Använd snedstreck som sökvägsavgränsare när du listar dem på :ref:`manifest "
"<extensions-manifest>`."

