msgstr ""
"`Python.org <https://www.python.org/>`__ -- Allmän information om Python."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"`Blender Python API <https://docs.blender.org/api/current/>`__ -- Official "
"API documentation. Use this for referencing while writing scripts."
msgstr ""
"`Blender Python API <https://docs.blender.org/api/current/>`__ -- Officiell "
"API-dokumentation. Använd den som referens när du skriver skript."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"`API Introduction "
"<https://docs.blender.org/api/current/info_quickstart.html>`__ -- A short "
"introduction to get you started with the API. Contains examples."
msgstr ""
"`API-introduktion "
"<https://docs.blender.org/api/current/info_quickstart.html>`__ -- En kort "
"introduktion som hjälper dig att komma igång med API:et. Innehåller exempel."

