#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Selecting UVs"
msgstr "Välja UV-objekt"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Much like the 3D Viewport, the UV Editor has selection mode buttons in the "
"header, as well as a *Select* menu."
