#. from yeager:blender
msgid ":doc:`Node Tree </render/shader_nodes/groups>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Nodträd </render/shader_nodes/groups>`"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Groups of re-usable nodes. Used in the node editors."
msgstr "Grupper av återanvändbara noder. Används i noderedigerarna."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ":doc:`Object </scene_layout/object/introduction>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Objekt </scene_layout/object/introduction>`"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"An entity in the scene with location, scale, rotation. Used by scenes & "
