msgid "**Blender goes Open Source, 1st Blender Conference.**"
msgstr "**Blender goes Open Source, 1st Blender Conference.**"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "2.25 -- October 2002:"
msgstr "2.25 -- Oktober 2002:"

