msgid ""
"`Blender Publisher <https://download.blender.org/release/Publisher2.25/>`__ "
"becomes freely available, and the experimental tree of Blender is created, a"
" coder's playground."
msgstr ""
"`Blender Publisher <https://download.blender.org/release/Publisher2.25/>`__ "
"blir fritt tillgängligt och Blenders experimentella träd skapas, en kodarens"
" lekplats."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "2.26 -- February 2003:"
msgstr "2.26 -- februari 2003:"

