msgstr ""
":ref:`Operatör för sammanslagning av lager "
"<bpy.ops.grease_pencil.layer_merge>`"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "The Grease Pencil object with multiple layers to combine."
msgstr "Grease Pencil-objektet med flera lager att kombinera."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Operate of a subset of layers by setting the field layer index value to "
