msgid ""
"Generates new hair curves on a surface mesh. The curves are generated from "
"scratch at point locations; if creating curves that depend on existing "
"curves is desired, the "
":doc:`/modeling/geometry_nodes/hair/generation/interpolate_hair_curves` is a"
" better choice."
msgstr ""
"Genererar nya hårkurvor på ett ytnät. Kurvorna genereras från grunden på "
"punktplatser; om man vill skapa kurvor som är beroende av befintliga kurvor "
"är :doc:`/modeling/geometry_nodes/hair/generation/interpolate_hair_curves` "
"ett bättre val."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"This node/modifier will not function without the *Surface* geometry/object "
"and *Surface UV Map* inputs."
msgstr ""
"Denna nod/modifier fungerar inte utan geometrin/objektet *Yta* och "
"ingångarna *Surface UV Map*."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Surface geometry for generation. This input takes priority over the "
"corresponding object input if both are provided."
msgstr ""
"Ytgeometri för generering. Denna indata har prioritet över motsvarande "
"objektindata om båda anges."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Surface object for generation (The transforms of this object must match the "
"modifier object)."
msgstr ""
"Ytobjekt för generering (transformationerna för detta objekt måste matcha "
"modifieringsobjektet)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Surface UV map stored on the mesh used for finding curve attachment "
