"semikolon."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Read USD Primvars as mesh attributes"
msgstr "Läs USD Primvars som mesh-attribut"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Read mesh color attributes"
msgstr "Läs mesh-färgattribut"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Read mesh UV coordinates"
msgstr "Läs mesh UV-koordinater"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Update the scene's start and end frame to match those of the USD archive"
msgstr ""
"Uppdatera scenens start- och slutbildruta så att de stämmer överens med dem "
"i USD-arkivet."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"If the Import USD Preview option is enabled, the material blend method will "
