#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Use selection as the pivot point"
msgstr "Använd urval som en central punkt"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Orbit method in the viewport"
msgstr "Orbit-metoden i visningsfönstret"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Trackball allows you to tumble your view at any angle"
msgstr "Med trackball kan du vrida vyn i valfri vinkel."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Scale trackball orbit sensitivity"
msgstr "Skala trackballens känslighet"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Rotation amount per pixel to control how fast the viewport orbits"
msgstr ""
"Rotationsmängd per pixel för att styra hur snabbt visningsfönstret roterar"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Continuous zooming. The zoom direction and speed depends on how far along "
