msgid "Selected UV Element"
msgstr "Valt UV-element"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Element Index"
msgstr "Elementindex"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Include this selection set when copying to the clipboard. If none are "
"specified, all sets will be copied."
msgstr ""
"Inkludera detta urval när du kopierar till urklipp. Om inget anges kopieras "
"alla urval."

