msgid "Base Scale"
msgstr "Bas skala"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Viewer reference scale associated with this landmark"
msgstr "Visningsreferensskala associerad med denna landmärken"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "VR Landmark"
msgstr "VR-landmärke"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Use scene's currently active camera to define the VR view base location and "
"rotation"
msgstr ""
"Använd scenens aktuella aktiva kamera för att definiera VR-vyns basposition "
"och rotation."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Use an existing object to define the VR view base location and rotation"
msgstr ""
"Använd ett befintligt objekt för att definiera VR-vyns basposition och "
"rotation."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Allow a manually defined position and rotation to be used as the VR view "
"base pose"
msgstr ""
"Tillåt att en manuellt definierad position och rotation används som VR-vyns "
"grundposition."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "ID Property"
msgstr "ID-egendom"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Property that stores arbitrary, user defined properties"
msgstr "Egenskap som lagrar godtyckliga, användardefinierade egenskaper"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Quaternion Attribute Value"
msgstr "Kvaternionattributvärde"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Rotation value in geometry attribute"
msgstr "Rotationsvärde i geometriattribut"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "EEVEE Raytrace Options"
msgstr "EEVEE Raytrace-alternativ"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Quality options for the raytracing pipeline"
msgstr "Kvalitetsalternativ för raytracing-pipeline"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Blur the resolved radiance using a bilateral filter"
msgstr "Sudda ut den upplösta strålningen med hjälp av ett bilateralt filter."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Reuse neighbor pixels' rays"
msgstr "Återanvänd grannpixelers strålar"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Accumulate samples by reprojecting last tracing results"
msgstr "Samla sampel genom att reprojicera de senaste spårningsresultaten"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Determines the number of rays per pixel. Higher resolution uses more memory."
msgstr ""
"Bestämmer antalet strålar per pixel. Högre upplösning använder mer minne."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Full resolution"
msgstr "Full upplösning"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Render this effect at 50% render resolution"
msgstr "Rendera denna effekt med 50% render-upplösning"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Render this effect at 25% render resolution"
msgstr "Rendera denna effekt med en upplösning på 25% render."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Render this effect at 12.5% render resolution"
msgstr "Rendera denna effekt med en upplösning på 12,5% render."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Render this effect at 6.25% render resolution"
msgstr "Rendera denna effekt med en upplösning på 6,25% render."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Screen-Trace Precision"
msgstr "Skärmspårningsprecision"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Precision of the screen space ray-tracing"
msgstr "Precisionsgraden för skärmrumsstrålspårning"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Screen-Trace Thickness"
msgstr "Skärmspårningstjocklek"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Surface thickness used to detect intersection when using screen-tracing"
msgstr ""
"Yttjocklek som används för att upptäcka skärningspunkter vid användning av "
"skärmspårning"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Raytrace Max Roughness"
msgstr "Raytrace Max Grovhet"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Maximum roughness to use the tracing pipeline for. Higher roughness surfaces"
" will use fast GI approximation. A value of 1 will disable fast GI "
"approximation."
msgstr ""
"Maximal grovhet för användning av spårningspipeline. Ytor med högre grovhet "
"använder snabb GI-approximation. Värdet 1 inaktiverar snabb GI-"
"approximation."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Enable noise reduction techniques for raytraced effects"
msgstr "Aktivera brusreduceringstekniker för raytraced-effekter"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Read-only Integer"
msgstr "Skrivskyddat heltal"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Region in a subdivided screen area"
msgstr "Region i ett underindelat skärmområde"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Active Panel Category"
msgstr "Aktiv panelkategori"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"The current active panel category, may be Null if the region does not "
"support this feature (NOTE: these categories are generated at runtime, so "
"list may be empty at initialization, before any drawing took place)"
msgstr ""
"Den aktuella aktiva panelkategorin kan vara Null om regionen inte stöder "
"denna funktion (OBS: dessa kategorier genereras vid körning, så listan kan "
"vara tom vid initialisering, innan någon ritning har ägt rum)."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "This region does not support panel categories"
msgstr "Denna region stöder inte panelkategorier."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Alignment of the region within the area"
msgstr "Justering av regionen inom området"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Don't use any fixed alignment, fill available space"
msgstr "Använd inte någon fast justering, fyll tillgängligt utrymme"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Region floats on screen, doesn't use any fixed alignment"
msgstr "Regionen flyter på skärmen och använder inte någon fast justering"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Region is split horizontally and vertically"
msgstr "Regionen är uppdelad horisontellt och vertikalt"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Region Data"
msgstr "Region Data"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Region specific data (the type depends on the region type)"
msgstr "Regionsspecifika data (typen beror på regiontypen)"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Region height"
msgstr "Regionens höjd"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "2D view of the region"
msgstr "2D-vy av regionen"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Region width"
msgstr "Regionens bredd"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "The window relative vertical location of the region"
msgstr "Fönstrets relativa vertikala placering i regionen"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "The window relative horizontal location of the region"
msgstr "Fönstrets relativa horisontella placering i regionen"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "3D View region data"
msgstr "3D-vy av regiondata"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Clip Planes"
msgstr "Klippplan"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Is Axis Aligned"
msgstr "Är axelinriktad"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Whether the current view is aligned to an axis (does not check whether the "
"view is orthographic, use \"is_perspective\" for that). Setting this will "
"rotate the view to the closest axis"
msgstr ""
"Om den aktuella vyn är inriktad mot en axel (kontrollerar inte om vyn är "
"ortografisk, använd \"is_perspective\" för det). Om du ställer in detta "
"roteras vyn till närmaste axel."

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Lock view rotation of side views to Top/Front/Right"
msgstr "Lås vyrotationen för sidovyarna till Övre/Framre/Högra"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Perspective Matrix"
msgstr "Perspektivmatris"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Current perspective matrix (``window_matrix * view_matrix``)"
msgstr "Aktuell perspektivmatris (``window_matrix * view_matrix``)"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Sync view position between side views"
msgstr "Synkronisera vyposition mellan sidovyer"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Clip view contents based on what is visible in other side views"
msgstr "Klipp visningsinnehåll baserat på vad som är synligt i andra sidovyer"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Use Clip Planes"
msgstr "Använd klippplan"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "View shift in camera view"
msgstr "Visa skift i kameravyn"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Zoom factor in camera view"
msgstr "Zoomfaktor i kameravyn"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Distance to the view location"
msgstr "Avstånd till utsiktsplatsen"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "View Location"
msgstr "Visa plats"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "View pivot location"
msgstr "Visa pivotplats"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "View Matrix"
msgstr "Visa matris"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Current view matrix"
msgstr "Aktuell visningsmatris"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "View Perspective"
msgstr "Visa perspektiv"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "View Rotation"
msgstr "Visa rotation"

