msgstr ""
"Antal gånger ljuset återinförs i ljusrutnät, 0 inaktivera indirekt diffust "
"ljus"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid "Clamp Glossy"
msgstr "Klämma Glansig"

#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"Clamp pixel intensity to reduce noise inside glossy reflections from "
