#. from yeager:blender
msgid ""
"The exception is NVIDIA GPUs connected with NVLink, where multiple GPUs can "
"share memory at a small performance cost. This is can be enabled with "
":ref:`Distributed Memory Across Devices <prefs-system-cycles-distributive-"
"memory>` in the preferences."
msgstr ""
"Undantaget är NVIDIA GPU:er som är anslutna med NVLink, där flera GPU:er kan"
